flowchart TD
  CASE([Case start]) --> HUB{Hub services up?}
  HUB -->|no| SKIP1[SKIP missing hub]
  HUB -->|yes| FIX{Fixture VPN-only?}
  FIX -->|no| FAIL1[FAIL isolation]
  FIX -->|yes| WAN{Upstream reachable?}
  WAN -->|no eth| FAIL2[FAIL Variant B]
  WAN -->|no cell| SKIP2[SKIP Variant A]
  WAN -->|yes| START[Start vpn component]
  START --> UP{ip_ready / connected?}
  UP -->|timeout| FAIL3[FAIL connect]
  UP -->|yes| PING{Overlay ping OK?}
  PING -->|no| FAIL4[FAIL data plane]
  PING -->|yes| PEER{Hub lists peer?}
  PEER -->|no| FAIL5[FAIL registry/peer]
  PEER -->|yes| REC[Disconnect + reconnect]
  REC --> UP2{ip_ready again?}
  UP2 -->|no| FAIL6[FAIL reconnect]
  UP2 -->|yes| PASS[PASS]
